OL,3,CManchester City confirm deal to sign
OL,4,CElliot Anderson
OL,6,FManchester City have confirmed a deal
OL,7,Fto sign midfielder Elliot Anderson
OL,8,Ffrom Nottingham Forest.
OL,10,FThe 23-year-old, currently preparing
OL,11,Ffor a World Cup last-16 match with
OL,12,FMexico, completed his medical in
OL,13,FKansas, where the national team are
OL,14,Fbased.
OL,16,FHe will make the switch when England's
OL,17,Finvolvement in the tournament is over.
OL,19,FReports suggest the transfer will cost
OL,20,FCity #116million, making Anderson the
OL,21,Fmost expensive British player ever.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
