OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1783963237
OL,3,CManchester City confirm deal to sign
OL,4,CElliot Anderson
OL,6,FA statement from City said:
OL,7,F"Manchester City and Nottingham Forest
OL,8,Fhave reached an agreement for the
OL,9,Ftransfer of Elliot Anderson.
OL,11,F"The formalities of the move will be
OL,12,Ffinalised upon his return to England.
OL,14,F"In the meantime, everyone at
OL,15,FManchester City wishes Elliot and the
OL,16,FEngland squad the very best of luck in
OL,17,Ftheir World Cup campaign and we look
OL,18,Fforward to welcoming him to Manchester
OL,19,Fin due course."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
