FL,370,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1783963237
OL,3,CManchester City confirm deal to sign
OL,4,CElliot Anderson
OL,6,FAnderson is the first signing for City
OL,7,Funder the new boss Enzo Maresca, who
OL,8,Fwas confirmed as Pep Guardiola's
OL,9,Freplacement earlier this week.
OL,11,FHe has started all four World Cup
OL,12,Fmatches, and national team boss Thomas
OL,13,FTuchel described him as the "full
OL,14,Fpackage."
OL,16,F"He's a top player. There's nothing
OL,17,Fmore to say, he's the full package.
OL,18,FI'm happy that he's with us on that
OL,19,Fkind of level and he's a key player
OL,20,Ffor us."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
